      "body": "Second quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.59 (down from ₹1.03 in 2Q 2025). Revenue: ₹324.9m (down 51% from 2Q 2025). Net income: ₹3.53m (down 43% from 2Q 2025). Profit margin: 1.1% (up from 0.9% in 2Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by lower expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 55% per year but the company’s share price has only fallen by 12% per year, which means it has not declined as severely as earnings.",
